{
  "components": {
    "schemas": {
      "ApplicationListResponse": {
        "description": "投递列表页。\n\n`total` / `has_more` 是**截断信号**：列表有固定上限（见 router 的 `LIST_LIMIT`），\n没有它们时第 201 条起永久不可见、且界面看起来「这就是全部」。",
        "properties": {
          "has_more": {
            "title": "Has More",
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "items": {
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApplicationSummary"
            },
            "title": "Items",
            "type": "array"
          },
          "total": {
            "title": "Total",
            "type": "integer"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "items",
          "total",
          "has_more"
        ],
        "title": "ApplicationListResponse",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "ApplicationStage": {
        "description": "投递所处阶段。顺序即流程顺序，界面按此排进度。",
        "enum": [
          "applied",
          "written_test",
          "interview",
          "offer",
          "rejected",
          "withdrawn"
        ],
        "title": "ApplicationStage",
        "type": "string"
      },
      "ApplicationSummary": {
        "description": "投递列表项。",
        "properties": {
          "applied_at": {
            "format": "date-time",
            "title": "Applied At",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "company": {
            "title": "Company",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "id": {
            "title": "Id",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "job_id": {
            "title": "Job Id",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "note": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Note"
          },
          "stage": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ApplicationStage"
          },
          "title": {
            "title": "Title",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "updated_at": {
            "format": "date-time",
            "title": "Updated At",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "id",
          "job_id",
          "company",
          "title",
          "stage",
          "applied_at",
          "updated_at"
        ],
        "title": "ApplicationSummary",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "ApplyResponse": {
        "description": "记录投递的结果。",
        "properties": {
          "application_id": {
            "title": "Application Id",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "application_id"
        ],
        "title": "ApplyResponse",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "CandidateProfile": {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "候选人画像。至少要有一项信号，否则评分无从谈起。",
        "properties": {
          "directions": {
            "items": {
              "maxLength": 100,
              "type": "string"
            },
            "maxItems": 20,
            "title": "Directions",
            "type": "array"
          },
          "keywords": {
            "items": {
              "maxLength": 100,
              "type": "string"
            },
            "maxItems": 50,
            "title": "Keywords",
            "type": "array"
          },
          "summary": {
            "default": "",
            "maxLength": 2000,
            "title": "Summary",
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "title": "CandidateProfile",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "CaptureStatus": {
        "description": "岗位详情的抓取状态。",
        "enum": [
          "unknown",
          "pending",
          "complete",
          "failed"
        ],
        "title": "CaptureStatus",
        "type": "string"
      },
      "ConnectionTestResponse": {
        "description": "连通性探测的结果 —— **有类型的响应**，不是裸 dict。\n\n裸 `dict[str, str]` 会让 OpenAPI 退化成 `additionalProperties: {type: string}`\n（契约里看不出有什么字段），前端只能靠魔法值判断：`probe.data.ok === \"1\"`。\n本仓库其余 5 个切片所有端点都有类型，唯独这里漏了（AGENTS.md「响应要有类型」）。\n\n`ok` 用 **bool** 而不是 \"1\"/\"0\"：字符串状态码有两个毛病 —— 前端得写\n`=== \"1\"` 这种依赖约定的比较；契约里也说不清 `ok` 到底有哪些取值。",
        "properties": {
          "message": {
            "title": "Message",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "ok": {
            "title": "Ok",
            "type": "boolean"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "ok",
          "message"
        ],
        "title": "ConnectionTestResponse",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "ConversationListResponse": {
        "description": "会话列表页。\n\n会话数量没有天然上限，所以这里是**真分页**：`page` / `page_size` / `has_next`\n让第 N 页起的会话都够得着。之前只有 `total` / `has_more`（截断信号）而没有翻页\n入口 —— 那时第 51 个起的会话不只是不可见，而是**完全无法触达**：界面能说\n「还有更多」，却没有任何办法把它取出来。\n\n与 `jobs` 的 `JobListResponse` 同一形状。`has_next` 比 `has_more` 少一层歧义：\n停在第 3 页时，「more」指「这一页之后还有」还是「比这一页更多」是含糊的。",
        "properties": {
          "has_next": {
            "title": "Has Next",
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          "items": {
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ConversationSummary"
            },
            "title": "Items",
            "type": "array"
          },
          "page": {
            "title": "Page",
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "page_size": {
            "title": "Page Size",
            "type": "integer"
          },
          "total": {
            "title": "Total",
            "type": "integer"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "items",
          "total",
          "page",
          "page_size",
          "has_next"
        ],
        "title": "ConversationListResponse",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "ConversationMessageView": {
        "description": "会话里的一条消息。",
        "properties": {
          "content": {
